{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"長沙灣海濱長廊印度排燈節　設彩燈許願池\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SSP-LIGHT-261108-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】有團體在長沙灣舉辦印度排燈節。</p><p>長沙灣海濱長廊懸掛多款色彩繽紛的彩燈，包括24盞曾於維園中秋綵燈會亮相的燈籠。現場亦設有許願池等給市民體驗放水燈許願，和試穿廣西服飾及印度彩繪。</p><p>活動由深水埗民政事務處和香港廣西社團總會合辦。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.796203+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:48:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:10.153573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:57.577675+00:00","content_hash":"83a1506d2a333bab0ac406d237fe1cec4209943539046feb2d9e33c73c64a239","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.796203+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}